er situation; another costs 1 or 9. With no probabilities and a smallest-worst-case-cost rule, which route should be chosen?</p><p><b>Highest observed:</b> Respan Span-02 · 8/8 (100.0%)</p><details><summary>All 31 routes in this category</summary><div class="ranked-category"><table><thead><tr><th>Model</th><th>Correct / questions (%)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Respan Span-02</th><td style="background:#081d58;color:#ffffff">8/8 (100.0%)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">GPT-6 Sol — no reasoning</th><td style="background:#225da8;color:#ffffff">6/8 (75.0%)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Opus 5 — no thinking, JSON-choice</th><td style="background:#225da8;color:#ffffff">6/8 (75.0%)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Drex Max</th><td style="background:#1d90c0;color:#000000">5/8 (62.5%)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cloudflare Clef Flash</th><td style="background:#1d90c0;color:#000000">5/8 (62.5%)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fastino GLiDE</th><td style="background:#40b5c4;color:#000000">4/8 (50.0%)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Mammoth-1</th><td style="background:#40b5c4;color:#000000">4/8 (50.0%)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Nimble v4 Max</th><td style="background:#40b5c4;color:#000000">4/8 (50.0%)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Liquid d1-ultra</th><td style="background:#40b5c4;color:#000000">4/8 (50.0%)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sonnet 5.5 — no thinking, JSON-choice</th><td style="background:#40b5c4;color:#000000">4/8 (50.0%)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Qwen3.8-Max — none, Hyper Charm</th><td style="background:#40b5c4;color:#000000">4/8 (50.0%)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Kev 4B</th><td style="background:#40b5c4;color:#000000">4/8 (50.0%)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Luna 6 Decisions</th><td style="background:#40b5c4;color:#000000">4/8 (50.0%)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Perplexity Decider v1.2</th><td style="background:#7ecdbb;color:#000000">3/8 (37.5%)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Amos 1 Large</th><td style="background:#7ecdbb;color:#000000">3/8 (37.5%)</td></tr